        "heading_U9cCAa": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A Modern Day, Old Fashioned Meat Market",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "image_cynGEf": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "badge__text": "<h2>70+ <\/h2><p>Years of Trust<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "text_WkppgW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Skill handed down from Generation to Generation.<\/h4><p> Roseville Meat Company has been a cornerstone of the Roseville community for over seven decades. What started as a small, neighborhood butcher shop has grown into the  region's premier destination for premium meats — but our values have  never changed.<br\/><br\/>As a local, family-owned business, we've built our  reputation on one thing: offering the very best in fresh meats with the  personal service that only a family business can provide. We know our  customers by name, and we take pride in helping you find exactly what  you need.<\/p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_size": "medium"
          }
        },
        "block_quote_PDLNnn": {
          "type": "block_quote",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p> \"From our family to yours, we offer the very best in fresh meats. That's not just a slogan — it's how we live every single day.\"<br\/><br\/><strong>— The Roseville Meat Company Family<\/strong><\/p>",
            "color_scheme": "scheme-2"
          }
        },
        "text_XndxUF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>From USDA Prime beef and fresh poultry to exotic  selections like buffalo and elk, we carry what others simply can't. And  with our custom processing services, we'll cut, wrap, and prepare your  order exactly the way you want it.<\/p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "text_size": "medium"
          }
        }
      },
